        },
        {
          "word": "Satan.",
          "start": 248.278,
          "end": 248.776,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Long time ago, a few billion years ago, Satan violated the absolute kingship of God.",
