          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "me.",
          "start": 282.826,
          "end": 283.157,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "God wanted us to know that.",
