          "end": 3434.799,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "\"why?\"",
          "start": 3434.799,
          "end": 3435.325,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "I said \"because I'm a Muslim, and I can't deal with alcohol.\"",
