          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "God.\"",
          "start": 4222.852,
          "end": 4223.238,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "It doesn't say \"I am God.\"",
