          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "Quran.",
          "start": 4869.665,
          "end": 4869.899,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "I have seen many people who have memorized the Quran for many, many years. They never lost it.",
