          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "For example, all the Mullahs in Egypt, graduates of Al-Azhar, they believe that Abraham's father in the Quran,",
      "start": 4887.676,
      "end": 4895.865,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
