        },
        {
          "word": "correction.",
          "start": 5092.219,
          "end": 5092.478,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "\"Before Joseph\", instead of \"for Joseph.\" If this is \"for Joseph\", it's ok. This is my understanding.",
